windows

conda 创建一个python 3.11的环境

conda install mkl

conda install gdal

pip install requirements.txt

pip install -r .\ApuCellGlobal\requirements.txt


打包说明

qrc文件修改后更新

pyrcc5 .\QTPackage\Window\Icon\ApuCPathIcon.qrc -o .\QTPackage\Window\IconCode\ApuCPathIcon_rc.py

ui文件修改后更新

pyuic5 .\QTPackage\Window\UI\WindowApuCPathMain.ui -o .\QTPackage\Window\UICode\MSWindowApuCPathMain.py --import-from QTPackage.Window.IconCode
pyuic5 .\QTPackage\Window\UI\WindowApuCPathSelectForDataset.ui -o .\QTPackage\Window\UICode\MSWindowApuCPathSelectForDataset.py --import-from QTPackage.Window.IconCode


